				<a href="https://help.servmask.com/knowledgebase/how-to-add-import-and-export-capabilities-to-wordpress-users/" target="_blank">Technische details</a>','To choose a file please go inside the link and click on the browse button.'=>'Ga naar de link en klik op de knop Bladeren om een bestand te kiezen.','Finish'=>'Voltooien','Please ensure your file was created with the All-in-One WP Migration plugin.
